# List Page

## Metadata

```yaml
format: uimd
format-version: 1
kind: component
status: regression
description: "Scrollable list page with interactive row buttons for the ViewHost focus regression."
tags: [regression, issue-5, scrollview]
```

## Definition

```yaml
extends: uiscrollview
uses:
  - item_row
```

## Style

```yaml
include: dark
this:
  border-width: 0
  background: "#030712"
@panel:
  gap: 1
  padding: 1, 1, 1, 1
  background: "#030712"
```

